@baseUrl = {{baseUrl}}

### CSV upload
# Expected: 200 OK on valid upload, 400 on validation error, or 401 when auth is required and missing
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=UseClevrBoundary
Cookie: authjs.session-token=<paste-local-session-cookie>

--UseClevrBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

month,revenue,expenses
2026-01,1000,500
2026-02,1100,550
--UseClevrBoundary--
